  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7402409",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740240901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740240901": {
            "id": "740240901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "What do you consider \"closest to the sun in color\"?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402410",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740241001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740241001": {
            "id": "740241001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, so this is what they call \"Cor Lapis.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241002"
            ]
          },
          "740241002": {
            "id": "740241002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, it is so warm... it smells so good and feels so soft — it truly is as gentle as the sun itself. Surely, humans must use these to make food? Anyway, thank you so much. I will remember this item.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241003"
            ]
          },
          "740241003": {
            "id": "740241003",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How... were you able to see all that?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402401",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740240101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740240101": {
            "id": "740240101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. What are you doing here all by yourself?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240102"
            ]
          },
          "740240102": {
            "id": "740240102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Gah! Don't suddenly talk to people while standing behind them! You almost made me scatter this powder...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240103"
            ]
          },
          "740240103": {
            "id": "740240103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Powder? Err, what's this stuff?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240104"
            ]
          },
          "740240104": {
            "id": "740240104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Gems!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240105"
            ]
          },
          "740240105": {
            "id": "740240105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gems? But why would there be any here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240106"
            ]
          },
          "740240106": {
            "id": "740240106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Wouldn't it be stranger to not find them here? I mean, this is my workshop, in which I process gems... Although I must admit that it doesn't have an official name yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240107"
            ]
          },
          "740240107": {
            "id": "740240107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "I did consider calling it \"Studio Sluasi\" in the past, but I'm not sure if using my name so directly is such a good idea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240108"
            ]
          },
          "740240108": {
            "id": "740240108",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What do you mean by \"processing gems\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240109"
            ]
          },
          "740240109": {
            "id": "740240109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "That means that I turn gems into various pretty ornaments... and stuff?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240110"
            ]
          },
          "740240110": {
            "id": "740240110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Unfortunately, I won't be able to take new commissions for a while. I need to concentrate on making paints... Well, I am still using gems for that, though.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240111"
            ]
          },
          "740240111": {
            "id": "740240111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You're gonna make paints out of gems? Are you serious?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240112"
            ]
          },
          "740240112": {
            "id": "740240112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Yes. What's wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240113"
            ]
          },
          "740240113": {
            "id": "740240113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um, well, it just feels like a waste... You could just give them to Paimon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240114"
            ]
          },
          "740240114": {
            "id": "740240114",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But still, why do you need to make paints? Paimon's pretty sure there's no such step in using gems to make ornaments, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240115"
            ]
          },
          "740240115": {
            "id": "740240115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Well, a child who loves painting came to ask me if I could make paints as shiny as gems and as bright as the sun.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240116"
            ]
          },
          "740240116": {
            "id": "740240116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Moreover, she recently saved my younger sister when the village was shaking very violently.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240117"
            ]
          },
          "740240117": {
            "id": "740240117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "That's why I've decided to try to fulfill her wish by creating a \"paint as bright as the sun\" and giving it to her as a thank-you gift.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240118"
            ]
          },
          "740240118": {
            "id": "740240118",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Wait, you must be referring to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240119"
            ]
          },
          "740240119": {
            "id": "740240119",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is the girl who enjoys painting you spoke of named Mamere?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240120"
            ]
          },
          "740240120": {
            "id": "740240120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Hmm? Yes... Do you two know her?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240121"
            ]
          },
          "740240121": {
            "id": "740240121",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You tell Sluasi about your previous experiences with Mamere...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240122"
            ]
          },
          "740240122": {
            "id": "740240122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "So... So the two of you are the esteemed ones who saved Puca alongside Mamere?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240123"
            ]
          },
          "740240123": {
            "id": "740240123",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Esteemed ones...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240126"
            ]
          },
          "740240126": {
            "id": "740240126",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Thank you. Thank you both so much! If it weren't for you, Puca might have been...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240127"
            ]
          },
          "740240127": {
            "id": "740240127",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Please, take these... If you don't mind, that is!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402402",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740240201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740240201": {
            "id": "740240201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "What do you consider <color=#00E1FFFF>\"closest to the sun in color\"</color>?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402403",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740240315"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740240315": {
            "id": "740240315",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Sluasi carefully checks the material before handing them back to you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240301"
            ]
          },
          "740240301": {
            "id": "740240301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Whatever the case, thank you two for your help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240302"
            ]
          },
          "740240302": {
            "id": "740240302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "#However, I cannot simply take what is yours, esteemed {NICKNAME}. Thus, I shall simply learn the name of that material from you, and I shall later set out to find it myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240303"
            ]
          },
          "740240303": {
            "id": "740240303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Still, would you not say that this color is a bit too... intense?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240304"
            ]
          },
          "740240304": {
            "id": "740240304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "The \"color of the sun\" should have a lighter touch, I think...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240305"
            ]
          },
          "740240305": {
            "id": "740240305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Do you mean that it should lean further toward being \"white\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240306"
            ]
          },
          "740240306": {
            "id": "740240306",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, that's true. The \"sun\" is more \"white\" than it is \"gold\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240307"
            ]
          },
          "740240307": {
            "id": "740240307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "\"White,\" you say? However, I am not sure what materials we must use to achieve this lighter shade...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240309",
              "740240312"
            ]
          },
          "740240309": {
            "id": "740240309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "I have tried that in the past... but it did not turn out so well. Colors produced that way turn out rather murky — they lack the striking brilliance the sun has...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240310"
            ]
          },
          "740240310": {
            "id": "740240310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "So it would be best if we could use some other material...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240314"
            ]
          },
          "740240314": {
            "id": "740240314",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That said, we can find all sorts of bright, white things around, can't we?"
          },
          "740240312": {
            "id": "740240312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You can't make paints outta hair!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240313"
            ]
          },
          "740240313": {
            "id": "740240313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And even if you could, you can't just pluck Paimon's!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402404",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740240401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740240401": {
            "id": "740240401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "\"Something <color=#00E1FFFF>white</color>\"... What is that?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402405",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740240516"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740240516": {
            "id": "740240516",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Sluasi carefully checks the material before handing them back to you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240501"
            ]
          },
          "740240501": {
            "id": "740240501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, I see, so this is the color that you call \"white,\" yes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240502"
            ]
          },
          "740240502": {
            "id": "740240502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "I cannot help but feel that this is the exact opposite of what the \"sun's color\" is. Would its opposite, then, not be more suitable?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240503"
            ]
          },
          "740240503": {
            "id": "740240503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Its \"opposite\"... You mean black?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240504"
            ]
          },
          "740240504": {
            "id": "740240504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "\"Black\"... Yes, that must be it. \"Black.\" A brilliant solution, esteemed Paimon. That must be the sun's color indeed!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240508",
              "740240507"
            ]
          },
          "740240508": {
            "id": "740240508",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But why black, though?"
          },
          "740240507": {
            "id": "740240507",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, you cut that out!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402406",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740240601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740240601": {
            "id": "740240601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "If I see something <color=#00E1FFFF>black</color>, I will be able to mix a color as radiant as the sun..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402407",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740240712"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740240712": {
            "id": "740240712",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Sluasi carefully checks the material before handing them back to you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240701"
            ]
          },
          "740240701": {
            "id": "740240701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Thank you very much. With this, I'm sure I shall be able to make pigments \"as bright as the sun,\" which I may then give her as a gift.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240702"
            ]
          },
          "740240702": {
            "id": "740240702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Will this really work...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240703"
            ]
          },
          "740240703": {
            "id": "740240703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Or rather, can you really make \"bright colors\" using such base materials?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240705",
              "740240707"
            ]
          },
          "740240705": {
            "id": "740240705",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But Sluasi sure does look happy, though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240708"
            ]
          },
          "740240708": {
            "id": "740240708",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Whatever the case, I thank you two for your help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240709"
            ]
          },
          "740240709": {
            "id": "740240709",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Please, take these as my thanks...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240710"
            ]
          },
          "740240710": {
            "id": "740240710",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sh—Shiny gems — and components, too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740240711"
            ]
          },
          "740240711": {
            "id": "740240711",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Hehe. I am glad you like them. If you desire any ornaments in the future, you know where to find me."
          },
          "740240707": {
            "id": "740240707",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's true, the colors Mamere uses are pretty weird too..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402411",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740241101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740241101": {
            "id": "740241101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, so this is what they call \"Cor Lapis.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241102"
            ]
          },
          "740241102": {
            "id": "740241102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, it is so warm... it smells so good and feels so soft — it truly is as gentle as the sun itself. Surely, humans must use these to make food? Anyway, thank you so much. I will remember this item.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241103"
            ]
          },
          "740241103": {
            "id": "740241103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How... were you able to see all that?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402412",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740241201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740241201": {
            "id": "740241201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, so this is the thing you call a \"Nilotpala Lotus.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241202"
            ]
          },
          "740241202": {
            "id": "740241202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Hmm. How strange. Why is it named for the moon, when it should be the thing \"closest in color to the sun\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241203"
            ]
          },
          "740241203": {
            "id": "740241203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, are the sun and moon really that different in color?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402413",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740241301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740241301": {
            "id": "740241301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, I see, I see... This is the \"Berry\" you spoke of.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241302"
            ]
          },
          "740241302": {
            "id": "740241302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "It is cold and hard, yet supple... and it stings the eyes like the sunlight of a winter afternoon. Surely this must be a metal that humans forge to make their weapons! Thank you very much. I shall remember this item.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241303"
            ]
          },
          "740241303": {
            "id": "740241303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How... were you able to see all that?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402414",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740241401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740241401": {
            "id": "740241401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Y'know, wouldn't \"a metal painted white\" simply be a \"White Iron Chunk\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241402"
            ]
          },
          "740241402": {
            "id": "740241402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. Come to think of it, considering the price difference between stone and metal, there might actually be some unscrupulous people who might paint stone to sell it as White Iron..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402415",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740241501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740241501": {
            "id": "740241501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Wow! It's so beautiful! And it even has a light scent to it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241502"
            ]
          },
          "740241502": {
            "id": "740241502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gathering them could be quite tough... But would that be a problem?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402416",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740241601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740241601": {
            "id": "740241601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, it's a pearl! But it feels a little different from the ones I've seen before. I sense a... coldness from it, of a sort.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241602"
            ]
          },
          "740241602": {
            "id": "740241602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe. This is no ordinary pearl. It's a Sango Pearl, which means \"coral pearl\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241603"
            ]
          },
          "740241603": {
            "id": "740241603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Hmm. Can corals produce pearls too? The outside world is truly fascinating...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241604"
            ]
          },
          "740241604": {
            "id": "740241604",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Err... That's not exactly true. It's called that because they grow near corals."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402417",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740241701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740241701": {
            "id": "740241701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "This is... an ordinary Iron Chunk. I see, so this is what you would term \"black\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241702"
            ]
          },
          "740241702": {
            "id": "740241702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, its shade is a little off, but Paimon reckons it'll work just fine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402418",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740241801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740241801": {
            "id": "740241801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Is this a bone from some creature? I see, I see. You mean to show that the \"blackness\" of the sun is all that remains once something has become bereft of all life...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241802"
            ]
          },
          "740241802": {
            "id": "740241802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't say that kind of weird stuff! Anyway, Sand Grease Pupae aren't bones, they're just the shells left behind by Quicksand Eels!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241803"
            ]
          },
          "740241803": {
            "id": "740241803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, like taking off old clothes? I see. They are very beautiful clothes, though. Now, if only I could sew together something similar..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402419",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740241901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740241901": {
            "id": "740241901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, I see, I see... This is the \"Berry\" you spoke of.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241902"
            ]
          },
          "740241902": {
            "id": "740241902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "It is cold and hard, yet supple... and it stings the eyes like the sunlight of a winter afternoon. Surely this must be a metal that humans forge to make their weapons! Thank you very much. I shall remember this item.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740241903"
            ]
          },
          "740241903": {
            "id": "740241903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How... were you able to see all that?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402420",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740242001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740242001": {
            "id": "740242001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Ah, so this is the thing you call a \"Nilotpala Lotus.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242002"
            ]
          },
          "740242002": {
            "id": "740242002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Hmm. How strange. Why is it named for the moon, when it should be the thing \"closest in color to the sun\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242003"
            ]
          },
          "740242003": {
            "id": "740242003",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, are the sun and moon really that different in color?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402421",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740242101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740242101": {
            "id": "740242101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Whatever the case, thank you two for your help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242102"
            ]
          },
          "740242102": {
            "id": "740242102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "#However, I cannot simply take what is yours, esteemed {NICKNAME}. Thus, I shall simply learn the name of that material from you, and I shall later set out to find it myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242103"
            ]
          },
          "740242103": {
            "id": "740242103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Still, would this \"gold\" be a bit too intense?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242104"
            ]
          },
          "740242104": {
            "id": "740242104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "The \"color of the sun\" should have a lighter touch, I think...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242105"
            ]
          },
          "740242105": {
            "id": "740242105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Do you mean that it should lean further toward being \"white\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242106"
            ]
          },
          "740242106": {
            "id": "740242106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, that's true. The \"sun\" is more \"white\" than it is \"gold\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242107"
            ]
          },
          "740242107": {
            "id": "740242107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "\"White,\" you say? However, I am not sure what materials we must use to achieve this lighter shade...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242109",
              "740242112"
            ]
          },
          "740242109": {
            "id": "740242109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "I have tried that in the past... but it did not turn out so well. Colors produced that way turn out rather murky — they lack the striking brilliance the sun has...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242110"
            ]
          },
          "740242110": {
            "id": "740242110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "So it would be best if we could use some other material...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242114"
            ]
          },
          "740242114": {
            "id": "740242114",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That said, we can find all sorts of bright, white things around, can't we?"
          },
          "740242112": {
            "id": "740242112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You can't make paints outta hair!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242113"
            ]
          },
          "740242113": {
            "id": "740242113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And even if you could, you can't just pluck Paimon's!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402422",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740242201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740242201": {
            "id": "740242201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "\"Something white\"... What is that?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402423",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740242301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740242301": {
            "id": "740242301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Y'know, wouldn't \"a metal painted white\" simply be a \"White Iron Chunk\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242302"
            ]
          },
          "740242302": {
            "id": "740242302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. Come to think of it, considering the price difference between stone and metal, there might actually be some unscrupulous people who might paint stone to sell it as White Iron..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7402424",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740242401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740242401": {
            "id": "740242401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sluasi",
            "text": "Wow! It's so beautiful! And it even has a light scent to it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740242402"
            ]
          },
          "740242402": {
            "id": "740242402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gathering them could be quite tough... But would that be a problem?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
